#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of xdg-utils"
msgstr "Instalação do xdg-utils"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Compile <application>xdg-utils</application> with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Compile o <application>xdg-utils</application> com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:102
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests for the scripts must be made from an X-Window based session.  "
"There are several run-time requirements to run the tests including a browser"
" and an MTA.  Running the tests as <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Os testes para os scripts precisam ser feitos a partir de uma sessão baseada"
" em Janelas do X. Existem vários requisitos de tempo de execução para "
"executar os testes, incluindo um navegador e um MTA. Executar-se os testes "
"como usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> não é "
"recomendado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue: <command>make -k test</command>."
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita: <command>make -k test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now install it as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora instale-o como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/xdg-utils.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

